{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A01", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum cooling‑off period that an NBFC must provide is one day.", "citations": ["D16_B_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00017917499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.9913204000004043, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2001, "output_tokens": 97, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0019", "D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0037", "D16_B_0073", "D16_B_0022"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.045838000001822365, "total_latency_s": 1.472563999999693, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A02", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "If an NBFC processes digital‑lending data outside India, the data must be deleted from any servers outside India and the data must be brought back to servers within India within 24 hours of the processing.", "citations": ["D16_B_0022"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0001836, "gen_latency_s": 0.7401495999984036, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1752, "output_tokens": 174, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0022", "D15_B_0018", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0024"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04022660000191536, "total_latency_s": 0.780467000000499, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A03", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The cap on Default Loss Guarantee (DLG) cover for a digital lending portfolio is five per cent of the total amount disbursed from that portfolio at any given time.", "citations": ["D16_B_0033"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002244, "gen_latency_s": 0.7491752999994787, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2472, "output_tokens": 130, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0033", "D16_B_0005", "D16_B_0039", "D16_B_0034", "D16_B_0028"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04098890000022948, "total_latency_s": 0.7902331000004779, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report the digital lending apps it uses on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank.", "citations": ["D16_B_0026"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000221475, "gen_latency_s": 0.9212569999981497, "rate_limit_wait_s": 9.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2573, "output_tokens": 95, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0027", "D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04207039999892004, "total_latency_s": 1.0553546000010101, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A lending service provider (LSP) must display a digital view of all loan offers that match the borrower’s request on the Digital Lending Application (DLA). This view must include the name(s) of the lender(s) extending the offer, the loan amount and tenor, APR, monthly repayment obligation and any penal charges, and must also link to the Know‑Your‑Customer (KFS) page for each lender. Unmatched lenders’ names should also be disclosed, and the content must be unbiased and not use dark or deceptive patterns.", "citations": ["D16_B_0013"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000215775, "gen_latency_s": 0.7511904999992112, "rate_limit_wait_s": 15.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2137, "output_tokens": 185, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0013", "D12_B_0053", "D16_B_0016", "D12_B_0064", "D16_B_0021"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04293049999978393, "total_latency_s": 0.8927671000019473, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes. An NBFC may retain a reasonable one‑time processing fee if a borrower exits a digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided that this fee is disclosed to the borrower upfront in the key‑features sheet.", "citations": ["D16_B_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022942499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.0957869999983814, "rate_limit_wait_s": 19.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2479, "output_tokens": 145, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0019", "D16_B_0018", "D16_B_0034", "D16_B_0005", "D16_B_0022"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.041964899999584304, "total_latency_s": 1.2274975000000268, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No. An NBFC (including its digital lending app) must not access a borrower’s phone resources such as the contact list or media files; only a one‑time access to camera, microphone, location or similar facilities for KYC is permitted with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_B_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00018779999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.0054701999979443, "rate_limit_wait_s": 14.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1888, "output_tokens": 154, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0023", "D16_B_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04172439999820199, "total_latency_s": 1.1458961999996973, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If a borrower does not receive any reply within 30 days of lodging a complaint, the borrower may lodge a complaint on the Reserve Bank’s Complaint Management System (CMS) portal (https://cms.rbi.org.in/) under the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre, 4th Floor, Reserve Bank of India, Sector‑17, Central Vista, Chandigarh – 160017.", "citations": ["D16_B_0020"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000223725, "gen_latency_s": 0.9532733999985794, "rate_limit_wait_s": 17.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2227, "output_tokens": 189, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04344729999866104, "total_latency_s": 1.0872251000000688, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
